[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3992078770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116999#issuecomment-3992078770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116999","id":3992078770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7t8kmy","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-03T16:12:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T16:12:51Z","body":"AFAICT this seems to be an issue about the Viewport/Window sizing differences between the first/subsequent runs, not a TileMapLayer specific issue. Smaller viewport on the first run = less tiles rendered.\n\nSystem info:\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600G with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.29 GiB memory\n\nFirst run|Second run\n-|-\n<img width=\"1175\" height=\"872\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04a10ccc-eebe-483f-bd3d-a87b7fb3186a\" />|<img width=\"1133\" height=\"876\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c3dbbac-8257-4942-9cba-28ed546af98b\" />\n\nNote that the label showing the size updated for me on the second run only after drag-moving the window.\n\nEmbedding Options:\n<img width=\"338\" height=\"148\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0cc72c2-fc80-4661-823a-981fa01378c1\" />\n\n- First run, 775x775 size (note the side borders):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5712c498-48fe-4f5f-9f58-ec46b0e8bf3a\n\n- Second run, 800x800 size (note no side borders; the Label is outdated until after moving the window):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d8bc526-3d91-4d46-841d-787625c840b2","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3992078770/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3993099464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116999#issuecomment-3993099464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116999","id":3993099464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uAdzI","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-03T19:33:50Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T19:33:50Z","body":"Great catch @kleonc - The project settings seem to specify the viewport sizing at 800x800, so the root issue would be the first launch opening the window at a smaller viewport size instead?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3993099464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3993189132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116999#issuecomment-3993189132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116999","id":3993189132,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uAzsM","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_t